  "qq.d.plus": "Give a point to {f}",
  "qq.d.ok": "Detector ready! The face of {name} scores {pts} and no other face reaches that figure.",
  "qq.d.no": "Not yet. The face of {name} scores {pts} and another face scores {other}. {name} has to score more than all the others.",
  "qq.a.h": "The network has a row of points for each character",
  "qq.a.p": "When it sees a face, each row adds up the points of the features the face has, and the character with the most points wins. At first all the points are 0 and the network knows nothing. When it makes a mistake, it raises points for the right character and lowers points for the one that sneaked in. That is how it learns.",
  "qq.a.one": "Show it a face",
